<title>FRANCE: MEPs approve EU-Slovenia interim trade accord.</title>
<headline>MEPs approve EU-Slovenia interim trade accord.</headline>
<dateline>STRASBOURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Parliament on Friday approved an interim agreement on trade between the European Union and Slovenia.</p>
<p>Trade between the EU and Slovenia has been growing fast since the Union recognised Slovenia's independence five years ago.</p>
<p>Slovenia requested membership of the EU in June this year, when the two sides signed an association agreement. The interim agreement applies the trade aspects of this accord pending ratification of the full agreement.</p>
</text>
